<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Exchange Bank H1 net sharply down.</title>
<headline>Korea Exchange Bank H1 net sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 253     vs    447</p>
<p>    Net			  41.74  vs     73.67</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	48.34  vs     95.27</p>
<p>    Revenue		 1,610.22  vs  1,301.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Korea Exchange Bank is one of South Korea's leading commercial banks. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
